{"4551420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHOTRUN", "steam_appid": 4551420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT FOR YOUR LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOTRUN</strong> is a brutal, fast-paced one-shot FPS where every move matters and every mistake is fatal. Armed with nothing but your shotgun and your reflexes, you’ll have to survive relentless encounters in a world that gives you no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No reloading. No hesitation. Just pure speed and precision.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/fc906e413a131434a5d6ced80a0f817d.poster.avif?t=1783955240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/fc906e413a131434a5d6ced80a0f817d.webm?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/fc906e413a131434a5d6ced80a0f817d.mp4?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through dark, claustrophobic office floors where danger lurks around every corner. Enemies come fast — and you’ll need to be faster. Blast your way through waves of resistance, turning tight corridors into scenes of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot counts. Every second matters. Adapt, react, survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/920c4ce33760265a0385e4b9ae551594.poster.avif?t=1783955240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/920c4ce33760265a0385e4b9ae551594.webm?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/920c4ce33760265a0385e4b9ae551594.mp4?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE CORPORATE LADDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple — reach The Manager. But nothing about the journey is easy. Fight your way through increasingly intense floors, master your movement, and prove that you deserve your promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this office, success isn’t earned — it’s taken.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/622e7b8b70249f75851028cd354b9d36.poster.avif?t=1783955240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/622e7b8b70249f75851028cd354b9d36.webm?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/622e7b8b70249f75851028cd354b9d36.mp4?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-fast, one-shot-one-kill gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk, high-reward combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist but brutal mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange and deadly corporate world</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT FOR YOUR LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOTRUN</strong> is a brutal, fast-paced one-shot FPS where every move matters and every mistake is fatal. Armed with nothing but your shotgun and your reflexes, you’ll have to survive relentless encounters in a world that gives you no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No reloading. No hesitation. Just pure speed and precision.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/fc906e413a131434a5d6ced80a0f817d.poster.avif?t=1783955240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/fc906e413a131434a5d6ced80a0f817d.webm?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/fc906e413a131434a5d6ced80a0f817d.mp4?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through dark, claustrophobic office floors where danger lurks around every corner. Enemies come fast — and you’ll need to be faster. Blast your way through waves of resistance, turning tight corridors into scenes of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot counts. Every second matters. Adapt, react, survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/920c4ce33760265a0385e4b9ae551594.poster.avif?t=1783955240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/920c4ce33760265a0385e4b9ae551594.webm?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551420/extras/920c4ce33760265a0385e4b9ae551594.mp4?t=1783955240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE CORPORATE LADDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb